msgid "显式时钟借用与浅睡眠"
msgstr "Explicit clock leases and shallow sleep"

msgid ""
"IO58 当前交付是静态 caller-owned 时钟接纳、排空屏障，以及 STM32F407 / GD32F470 固定 RUN "
"配置下的一次浅睡眠。组件不创建全局 PM 注册表、任务、定时器、最大对象池或 默认状态。未显式选用的 `Nexus::ClockDomain` 是 "
"`EXCLUDE_FROM_ALL` 静态目标；两个 SoC 的 sleep 源也须由显式可选目标引用。板卡不自动选 GPIO 唤醒或改变电气连接。"
msgstr ""
"The current IO58 delivery provides static caller-owned clock admission, a "
"drain barrier, and one shallow sleep under fixed STM32F407 / GD32F470 RUN "
"configurations. The component creates no global PM registry, task, timer, "
"maximum object pool or default state. Unselected `Nexus::ClockDomain` "
"remains an `EXCLUDE_FROM_ALL` static target; sleep sources for both SoCs "
"also require explicit optional-target references. Boards do not "
"automatically select GPIO wake or alter electrical connections."

msgid ""
"公共 API 使用 opaque `nx_clock_domain_t`，mutable storage / constructor 只供私有 "
"装配。消费者提供自然对齐、零初始化的 `nx_clock_lease_t`。接纳成功后，token 的对象 身份和存储被借用，字段由 provider "
"管理；复制字段不能释放原对象。每个 domain 的显式 capacity 为别名和 retained identity "
"扫描给出上限，不承诺与容量无关的常数时间。"
msgstr ""
"The public API uses opaque `nx_clock_domain_t`; mutable storage / "
"constructors are private assembly details. The consumer supplies a naturally"
" aligned, zero-initialized `nx_clock_lease_t`. Successful admission borrows "
"the token's identity and storage, with provider-managed fields; copying "
"fields cannot release the original object. Each domain's explicit capacity "
"bounds alias and retained-identity scans; no capacity-independent constant "
"time is promised."

msgid ""
"生命周期的唯一 privileged Thread owner 调用 `close`，禁止新增 lease，再自行推动 "
"每个设备停止、DMA/IRQ/完成通知排空。消费者成功 detach 后才 release。close 本身 不取消设备，release "
"不证明外设已停止。现存 lease 不因超时、关闭或睡眠被撤回。 `quiescent` 仅在当前 closed epoch 且 count/list "
"同时为空时返回成功；reopen 只有在 排空后才能单调提升 admission epoch，最大值永久拒绝复用。旧控制值不能跨 epoch "
"重开或建立排空凭证。domain storage 的生命周期长于全部控制副本，禁止 memset 重置。"
msgstr ""
"The sole privileged Thread lifecycle owner calls `close` to prevent new "
"leases, then drives each device's stop and drains DMA/IRQ/completion "
"notifications itself. Consumers release only after successful detach. Close "
"does not cancel devices, and release does not prove a peripheral stopped. "
"Timeout, close or sleep never revoke existing leases. `quiescent` succeeds "
"only in the current closed epoch with both count and list empty. Reopen can "
"monotonically advance the admission epoch only after drain; the maximum "
"permanently rejects reuse. Old control values cannot reopen across epochs or"
" establish drain proof. Domain storage outlives all control copies; "
"resetting it with memset is prohibited."

msgid ""
"metadata 保存恢复 incoming PRIMASK；Native 使用真实递归线程排他模型。acquire / release 可在 "
"same-CPU privileged Thread、PendSV、SysTick 或外部 configurable IRQ "
"使用；构造、close、quiescent、reopen 为 serialized privileged Thread。NMI、fault、 "
"SMP、signal 或其他安全域调用不在合同内。输出和 wake word 不能覆盖私有 provider、 retained token "
"或彼此；拒绝不能破坏已借用控制。没有回调或 token release 后的访问。"
msgstr ""
"Metadata saves/restores incoming PRIMASK; Native uses a real recursive "
"thread-exclusion model. Acquire / release may run in same-CPU privileged "
"Thread, PendSV, SysTick or external configurable IRQ; construction, close, "
"quiescent and reopen require serialized privileged Thread. NMI, fault, SMP, "
"signals and other security domains are outside the contract. Outputs and "
"wake words cannot overlap private provider state, retained tokens or each "
"other; rejection cannot corrupt already borrowed controls. There are no "
"callbacks or accesses after token release."

msgid ""
"SoC sleep 在 incoming PRIMASK/BASEPRI/FAULTMASK 全清的 privileged Thread 调用。 "
"同一个保存掩码下最终验证 closed barrier、真实寄存器固定配置和 wake sequence，再 进入既有生产 "
"`nx_arch_wait_for_interrupt`。WFI 保持 PRIMASK，已使能 IRQ 变为 pending "
"可以唤醒，恢复掩码后运行；返回后 owner 必须重检真实业务谓词。序列变化则成功返回 `slept=false`。SCR.SLEEPDEEP "
"已设置、STOP、动态 RUN 均明确拒绝；从不改写 SCR、 RCC、Flash、Tick、pending IRQ 或 deadline。32-bit"
" wake sequence 需要调用者证明 观察窗口内不会完整绕回；不声称用一个快照解决 DMA/NMI/SMP 发布或无界 ABA。"
msgstr ""
"SoC sleep runs in privileged Thread with incoming PRIMASK/BASEPRI/FAULTMASK "
"all clear. Under the same saved mask it finally verifies the closed barrier,"
" actual fixed register configuration and wake sequence, then enters "
"production `nx_arch_wait_for_interrupt`. WFI preserves PRIMASK; an enabled "
"IRQ becoming pending can wake it and runs after mask restoration. The owner "
"must reread the actual business predicate after return. A changed sequence "
"returns success with `slept=false`. Set SCR.SLEEPDEEP, STOP and dynamic RUN "
"are explicitly rejected; SCR, RCC, Flash, Tick, pending IRQs and deadlines "
"are never rewritten. A 32-bit wake sequence requires the caller to prove no "
"complete wrap within the observation window; one snapshot does not solve "
"DMA/NMI/SMP publication or unbounded ABA."

msgid ""
"实际验证的 STM32 profile 为 nominal HSE8 MHz / M8 / N336 / P2 / Q7，SYSCLK/AHB168、 "
"APB1 42、APB2 84 MHz，Flash5WS，SSCG disabled；GD 为 nominal HXTAL25 / M25 / N400"
" / P2 / Q9，SYSCLK/AHB200、APB1 50、APB2 100 MHz，Flash7WS，SSCG disabled、 "
"TIMERSEL=0。来源是 pinned SDK 的 RCC/RCU/FMC register definitions 与当前 SoC "
"system.c 固定启动值。GD main Q9 不能宣称 USB48 MHz，独立 USB clock owner 另负其责。晶振实际 "
"频率、供电、热漂移和板卡布局不能由 ready/divisor 读回测得，仍需 physical qualification。"
msgstr ""
"The verified STM32 profile is nominal HSE8 MHz / M8 / N336 / P2 / Q7, "
"SYSCLK/AHB168, APB1 42, APB2 84 MHz, Flash5WS and SSCG disabled; GD is "
"nominal HXTAL25 / M25 / N400 / P2 / Q9, SYSCLK/AHB200, APB1 50, APB2 100 "
"MHz, Flash7WS, SSCG disabled and TIMERSEL=0. Sources are pinned SDK "
"RCC/RCU/FMC register definitions and fixed startup values in current SoC "
"system.c. GD main Q9 cannot claim USB48 MHz; the separate USB clock owner is"
" responsible. Actual crystal frequency, supply, thermal drift and board "
"layout cannot be measured through ready/divisor readback and still require "
"physical qualification."

msgid ""
"owner 必须独占 RCC 决策，登记全部相关消费者，并提供实际 enabled wake IRQ；模块不 发现遗漏消费者或隐式暂停内核。实际 "
"deep STOP / PLL 改频扩展必须先排空，停止全部 Tick/time providers、scheduler deadline "
"borrowers 与 IRQ，再由独占硬件端口实施有限 clock restore / rollback；clock/time 的新域需 cold "
"重建，旧绝对 deadline 不可继承。 本切片没有实现这些扩展，不把 admission epoch 伪装成时间域转换。"
msgstr ""
"The owner must exclusively control RCC decisions, register all relevant "
"consumers and provide an actually enabled wake IRQ; this module discovers no"
" omitted consumers and never implicitly pauses a kernel. Actual deep STOP / "
"PLL frequency-change extensions must first drain and stop all Tick/time "
"providers, scheduler deadline borrowers and IRQs, then use an exclusive "
"hardware port for bounded clock restore / rollback. New clock/time domains "
"need cold reconstruction; old absolute deadlines cannot be inherited. This "
"slice does not implement these extensions or disguise an admission epoch as "
"time-domain conversion."

msgid ""
"Google 测试使用真实生产 domain、真实 Native 排他、两家真实 SDK 的 MMIO布局和既有 生产 Arch sleep，只替换 "
"CPU context / WFI 外部叶子。原始链接 RED、SSCG/TIMERSEL/ non-head token "
"真实失败回归、GREEN、ASan/UBSan、strict ARM 和身份见 `tools/testing/evidence/clock-"
"domain-iteration/manifest.json`。这不是 clean release、 整机零 RAM/双离线重建或 physical "
"HIL/WCET/功耗资格；这些由后续平台集成/工位证据建立。"
msgstr ""
"Google tests use the real production domain, real Native exclusion, both "
"vendors' actual SDK MMIO layouts and production Arch sleep, replacing only "
"external CPU context / WFI leaves. Original link RED, actual "
"SSCG/TIMERSEL/non-head-token failure regressions, GREEN, ASan/UBSan, strict "
"ARM checks and identities are in `tools/testing/evidence/clock-domain-"
"iteration/manifest.json`. These are not clean-release, whole-system zero-"
"RAM/two-offline-build, physical HIL/WCET or power qualifications; later "
"platform-integration/station evidence establishes those."
